<title>THAILAND: Padaeng Q3 net loss reduced.</title>
<headline>Padaeng Q3 net loss reduced.</headline>
<dateline>BANGKOK 1996-11-15</dateline>
<text>
<p>Audited consolidated financial results for three and nine months ending September 30, 1996.</p>
<p>		   (in millions of baht unless stated)</p>
<p>					   Third quarter</p>
<p>    Shr (baht) (loss)	 (0.79)     vs     (1.88)</p>
<p>    Net	  (loss)	 (95.35)    vs   (195.79)</p>
<p>					    Nine months</p>
<p>    Shr (baht) (loss)	 (3.41)     v	(3.01)</p>
<p>    Net	  (loss)	 (374.029)  vs   (312.92)</p>
<p>NOTES: Company's full name is Padaeng Industry Plc, a mining company.</p>
<p>-- Bangkok newsroom (662) 652-0642</p>
